 processes the input and generates a refined query, 'Read the following com=
pany policy and r...', which is then directed to a data source (represented=
 by a dashed box).  Separately, a second path originates from the same 'Pro=
mpt Engine...', connecting to a 'General-purpose...' component. This compon=
ent processes information and produces an output, 'The company reimburses e=
