<h6 id=3D"locality-sensitive-hashing-lsh">Locality-sensitive hashing (LSH)<=
/h6>
<p>LSH groups similar points into buckets using specialized hash functions.=
 These functions ensure that points close in space are hashed into the same=
 bucket. This drastically reduces the search space because only points in t=
he same bucket as the query need to be examined, making LSH highly efficien=
t for large datasets. You can learn more about LSH by reading [23].</p>
