<h2 id=3D"evaluation">Evaluation</h2>
<p>Unlike traditional ML models, which are evaluated using well-defined qua=
ntitative metrics, evaluating RAG systems is more complex. This complexity =
arises because the quality of the final text response depends on the effect=
iveness of multiple components within the pipeline. To capture this multifa=
ceted evaluation, we use a triad diagram to explain the relationship betwee=
n different evaluation aspects.</p>
<figure class=3D"py-1"><div style=3D"display: flex; justify-content: center=
