<h4 id=3D"answer-correctness">Answer correctness</h4>
<p>Answer correctness focuses on how closely the generated answer matches t=
he correct reference answer. It measures the similarity between the two usi=
ng popular metrics including BLUE, ROGUE, and METEOR. To review these metri=
cs, refer to Chapter 3.</p>
