<h2 id=3D"overall-ml-system-design">Overall ML System Design</h2>
<p>A RAG system consists of several components that work together to retrie=
ve and generate responses efficiently. In this section, we will explore the=
 following key components:</p>
<ul>
<li>Indexing process</li>
<li>Safety filtering</li>
<li>Query expansion</li>
<li>Retrieval</li>
<li>Generation</li>
</ul>
